---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/ai-tells-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/ai-tells-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Fewer em dashes, fewer stock phrases"
  caption={'Share of intros with each tell. Stock phrases include "resonates" and "at the intersection of."'}
>
  Slope chart comparing 2,630 intros on earlier postings with the 769 applications on these four roles. Intros with stock phrases fell from 29 percent to 17 percent. Intros with em dashes fell from 14 percent to 5 percent.
</Chart>
